    },
    "text": "When an operator works in a host (Claude Code, Copilot CLI, Codex, `agy`) and calls Delphi, the work should happen **in the host**, with the host's full tools and skills, and Delphi should supply the persona, method, specs, knowledge, memory and the checks the host cannot do for itself. Delphi runs a role **inside** only where its audit trail or its model families are the point."
